#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:5
#: 21bd12bb1fc74d009e2da1809168bbc1
msgid "RangeFinders Setup Overview"
msgstr "测距仪设置概览"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:7
#: 004e2252a7b94291b48034e4558fd3fb
msgid ""
"There are many different kinds of rangefinders: Lidar (using laser or "
"infra-red light to measure distance), Sonar (using ultrasonic sound), and"
" Radar (using microwave RF). Some are analog, producing  pulses whose "
"timing represent the distance to an object, others are digital sending "
"data streams over serial to UARTs, or I2C, or even via DroneCAN."
msgstr ""
"测距仪有多种类型：激光雷达（利用激光或红外光测距）、声呐（利用超声波）和雷达（利用微波射频）。部分为模拟型，通过脉冲时序表示与目标的距离；其他为数字型，通过串口、I2C"
" 或 DroneCAN 发送数据流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:9
#: f6b6c33742604921b7ff3f5c27133701
msgid ""
":ref:`RangeFinders (Sonar or Lidar) <common-rangefinder-landingpage>` can"
" be used for :ref:`Object Avoidance <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>` as well as altitude sensors for precision landing in Plane and "
"Copter."
msgstr ""
":ref:`测距仪（声呐或激光雷达）<common-rangefinder-landingpage>` 可用于 :ref:`避障 <common-"
"object-avoidance-landing-page>` 以及 Plane 和 Copter 精准降落时的高度传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:15
#: b9e22867000542b4ae63dbf3c12ba5d0
msgid ""
":ref:`common-object-avoidance-landing-page` features are new and should "
"be used with caution."
msgstr ":ref:`common-object-avoidance-landing-page` 功能为新特性，使用时应保持谨慎。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:18
#: ede5208ea0424f67a39da0124d1f5941
msgid ""
"Up to 10 Rangefinders can be used in the system (1 thru A). :ref:`Object "
"Avoidance <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>` can use a single 360 "
"degree Lidar, or up to 9 unidirectional rangefinders: 8 arranged in a "
"circle covering 45 degree wide segments, plus an upward facing "
"rangefinder. And a downward facing rangefinder used for low altitude "
"height above ground measurements."
msgstr ""
"系统最多可使用 10 个测距仪（编号 1 至 A）。:ref:`避障 <common-object-avoidance-landing-"
"page>` 可使用单个 360 度激光雷达，或最多 9 个单向测距仪：8 个呈圆形排列，每个覆盖 45 "
"度扇区，加上一个朝上测距仪。另有一个向下测距仪用于低空离地高度测量。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:21
#: 2b7ef693cf394be29e3b7a4fe6b0b93d
msgid "Connecting and Configuring the Rangefinder"
msgstr "连接和配置测距仪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:23
#: 358d500534d7476c837f35cdee0753b5
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions for each type of rangefinder described in its "
"linked page on :ref:`common-rangefinder-landingpage`."
msgstr "请按照 :ref:`common-rangefinder-landingpage` 上各类测距仪链接页面中的说明进行操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:24
#: 1010f15e016e4169a12285a3bbbb8ead
msgid ""
"Set the RNGFNDx_ORIENT parameters (i.e. :ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT "
"<RNGFND1_ORIENT>`, :ref:`RNGFND2_ORIENT <RNGFND2_ORIENT>`, etc.) to "
"specify the direction each range finder is pointing in."
msgstr ""
"设置 RNGFNDx_ORIENT 参数（即 :ref:`RNGFND1_ORIENT "
"<RNGFND1_ORIENT>`、:ref:`RNGFND2_ORIENT <RNGFND2_ORIENT>` 等）以指定每个测距仪的朝向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:26
#: 308c703a06dd43069868d5b0574ce43a
msgid ""
"Note that if the type of rangefinder is set or changed, a reboot will be "
"required."
msgstr "请注意，若更改测距仪类型设置，需要重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:30
#: f7387c05e2484bf3948bf35172c1a81a
msgid ""
"Set the parameter ``PRXx_TYPE`` = 4 for each horizontal rangefinder(s) to"
" use them as Proximity Sensors (For obstacle avoidance)."
msgstr "将每个水平方向测距仪的参数 ``PRXx_TYPE`` 设置为 4，以将其用作近距传感器（用于避障）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:31
#: d8f3400214b0475dac325965c7b9f2b2
msgid ""
"For Copter and Rover, up to 8 rangefinders may placed around the vehicle "
"to provide 360 degree coverage, or a single 360 degree Lidar. But only "
"one forward facing rangefinder is required for :ref:`Object Avoidance "
"<common-object-avoidance-landing-page>`."
msgstr ""
"对于 Copter 和 Rover，最多可在飞行器周围布置 8 个测距仪以提供 360 度全向覆盖，或使用单个 360 度激光雷达。但 "
":ref:`避障 <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>` 只需一个前向测距仪即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:32
#: c63ad6fb6a7f4577a6905ae6851a63fc
msgid ""
"If a rangefinder is oriented facing up, then it will be used in the :ref"
":`common-simple-object-avoidance` operation as an upwards sensing "
"proximity sensor in Copter LOITER, ALTHOLD, and POSHOLD modes."
msgstr ""
"若测距仪朝上安装，则将在 Copter 的 Loiter、AltHold 和 PosHold 模式中作为向上探测的近距传感器用于 :ref"
":`common-simple-object-avoidance` 功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:37
#: 9bd0fb4dd6d54c7b8d0e402db22af66c
msgid "References"
msgstr "参考资料"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:39
#: 98b434bf3ca846b8906a6e3601d0bf5b
msgid ""
"Object Avoidance wiki page is :ref:`here <common-object-avoidance-"
"landing-page>`"
msgstr "避障 Wiki 页面见 :ref:`此处 <common-object-avoidance-landing-page>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-setup.rst:41
#: 1a761167b2424cd981ff745d2559ea57
msgid ""
"More details of the algorithms used in :ref:`common-simple-object-"
"avoidance` are on the :ref:`developer wiki's object avoidance page <code-"
"overview-object-avoidance>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`common-simple-object-avoidance` 中使用的算法详情见 :ref:`开发者 Wiki 避障页面 "
"<code-overview-object-avoidance>`"

